==Old English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ang|huæt|huæd|huædd|huætd|huædt|hwet|wæt|whæt|hwat}}

===Etymology===
{{dercat|ang|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*hwat}}.

Cognates include {{cog|ofs|hwet}}, {{cog|osx|hwat}}, {{cog|odt|wat}}, {{cog|goh|waz}}, {{cog|non|hvat}}. The Indo-European root also led to {{cog|la|quod}}, {{cog|lt|kàd}}, and {{cog|ga|cad}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ang-IPA|hwæt}}

