#*: {{quote|ang|''Dǣdlīcu word ġeswitoliaþ '''hwæt''' menn dōþ.''|Active verbs express '''what''' people do.}}
#* '''c. 992''', [[w:Ælfric of Eynsham|Ælfric]], [https://books.google.com/books?id=2xobVW92JLcC&pg=PA182 “Midlent Sunday”]
