#*: {{quote|ang|'''''Hwæs''' ābītst þū?''|'''What''' are you waiting for?}}
#* ''[https://books.google.com/books?id=8UQrAQAAIAAJ&pg=PA116 The Legend of St. Andrew]''
#*: {{quote|ang|''Ealle menn flēoþ of þǣre ċeastre. Tō '''hwon''' willaþ ġē þæder faran?''|Everyone’s fleeing that city. '''What''' do you want to go there for?}}
# [[why]]
#* '''late 9th century''', [[w:Alfred the Great|King Alfred's]] [https://books.google.com/books?id=At1SV29bH4oC&pg=PA38 translation] of [[w:Boethius|Boethius']] ''{{w|The Consolation of Philosophy}}''
#*: {{quote|ang|'''''Hwæt''' seofast þū wiþ mē?''|'''Why''' are you groaning at me?}}
