#*: {{quote|ang|''His leornungcneohtas wundrodon þæt hē wiþ wīf spræc, þēah heora nān ne cwæþ “Hwæt sēcst þū?” oþþe “'''Hwæt''' spricst þū wiþ hīe?”''|His disciples were amazed that he was talking to a woman, though none of them said “What are you looking for?” or “'''Why''' are you talking to her?”}}
# [[what]] [[kind]] ''(+genitive)''
